      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2015 National Kidney Foundation, Inc. Published by Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Historically nephrolithiasis was considered a disease of dehydration and abnormal urine composition. However, over the past several decades, much has been learned about the epidemiology of this disease and its relation to patient demographic characteristics and common systemic diseases. Here we review the latest epidemiologic studies in the field."
      },
